    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like, even if i get a new job or slowly pay it back, that feeling of being a complete disaster is never going away. everything is just broken. why do people make it sound so easy to just \"start over\" when you've literally lost the foundation of who you are? it feels like a trap i can't escape. there's no logic to any of this, it's just constant, endless suffering.",
